811
01:31:28,855 --> 01:31:30,857
Vão! Vão!

812
01:31:32,609 --> 01:31:33,693
Droga!

813
01:31:36,529 --> 01:31:38,198
Vão!

814
01:31:39,824 --> 01:31:40,867
Vão!

