863
01:38:53,341 --> 01:38:55,635
Nossa!

864
01:38:55,677 --> 01:38:57,554
Cuidado!

865
01:38:57,971 --> 01:38:59,764
Vamos, vamos!

866
01:39:02,100 --> 01:39:04,310
Vão, vão, vão!

867
01:39:04,352 --> 01:39:06,688
